	(text_box "Notes:\n\nMake sure to use Diametric magnets.\nRecommended DigiKey 469-1024-ND.\n\nMagnet must be centered to middle of package.\n\nNon-Volatile memory can only be burned ONCE.\n\nPull all SPI pins low when not in use\n\nDefault settings are:\n- ABI Decimal Mode @ 4000 steps/rev\n- W is PWM Output"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
